PETSELFTEST1
# V4-02 motion reactions and V3 rhythm wiring. Gestures are injected with
# "gesture" steps: this checks the board path, the IMU thresholds are
# host-tested with the V1 round 3 recordings (test_gesture_detector).
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect commits 1
# expect min:kind=pickup 1
# expect min:name=greet 2
# expect min:name=giggle 1
# expect min:name=dizzy 1
# expect min:acted=1 4
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
wait 20000
pet
wait 7000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 7000
hold press 1500 7000
mark begin
# Pickup: the durable "says hi" action, then a wave.
gesture pickup
wait 7000
# Gentle shake: giggle. Hard shake: dizzy, no reward.
gesture gentle
wait 5000
gesture hard
wait 6000
# Peekaboo: face down, then up again -> "found you" wave.
gesture facedown
wait 1500
gesture faceup
wait 6000
pet
wait 4000
end
